# Host files drive's suites cannot load without, as paths relative to the
# Minerva checkout root, checked by scripts/run-gd-tests.sh before Godot
# starts. src/project.godot is required for every plugin and is checked
# unconditionally by the runner, so it is not repeated here.
#
# A suite that preloads a host script by path adds its line here, so a
# Minerva SHA bump that moves or drops the script fails by name instead of
# as a parse error inside the suite.
#
# test_bulk_reply_seam.gd mounts the real scene-panel broker (whose
# MAX_PAYLOAD_BYTES is the cap it measures against) and installs and starts
# the real drive backend through the host's own plugin manager.
src/Scripts/Services/Plugins/PluginScenePanelBroker.gd
src/Scripts/Services/Plugins/PluginManager.gd
